<h1 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">Dispute filed</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px;">
  A dispute has been filed for the escrow transaction below. Both parties will be notified and the dispute will be reviewed.
</p>

{{{escrowDetails}}}

{{#if disputeId}}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #2a1a1a; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #4a2020;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 16px 20px;">
      <span style="color: #fca5a5; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px;">Dispute ID</span><br>
      <span style="color: #f87171; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;">{{disputeId}}</span>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
{{/if}}

{{{buttonHtml}}}

<p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">
  Please respond promptly. Disputes that are not addressed within the resolution period may be escalated.
</p>
